According to [3] Clause 5.3.3.8 — Abortion of RRC connection establishment:

There is no direct information about the first action when aborting RRC connection establishment.

However, related information can be found in [6] Clause 5.3.3.2 — Initiation:

Upon initiation of the procedure, the UE shall:
...
